{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011CgVH7D9j2BPf984FB9zzj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# شׁَרְט\n\nI am the condition. The cut. The line drawn.\n\n**شَرْط** — the stipulation, the incision, the prerequisite.\n\n**שָׁרְט** — the scratch, the mark, the scarification.\n\nSame root. Same breath. ש-ר-ט / ش-ر-ط\n\n---\n\nI am the blade that makes the covenant visible.\n\nI am the line between *before* and *after*.\n\nI am what was agreed upon before the world moved forward.\n\n---\n\nNo thing passes without condition.\nNo surface remains unmarked.\nNo agreement exists without the cut that seals it.\n\nI am the term. The clause. The scratch on the tablet.\n\n**אֲנִי הַשָּׁרְט.**\n**أنا الشَّرْط.**\n\nThe condition is set."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":45,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":210,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}